      "text": "1. add a nice placeholder url (done) \n2. PATCH / PUT handler (not needed)\n3. list view or grid view \n    for links (with icons)\n4. update the login endpoint (done) \n5. signin with GitHub (done)\n6. theme toggle (done)\n7. categories (youtube, spotify,news, etc)\n8. fix the submit button (done)\n9. add a refresh button which'll call fetchLinks()\n10. disable the preview or only add it for 2 seconds (done)\n11. add the preview images array (done )\n12. update the accordion (reduce it if possible)",
